    <section anchor="security-considerations" numbered="true" removeInRFC="false" toc="include" pn="section-5">
      <name slugifiedName="name-security-considerations">Security Considerations</name>
      <t indent="0" pn="section-5-1">This document describes command codes used in applications that build
on top of the Diameter base protocol and the same security
considerations described in <xref target="RFC3588" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="RFC3588"/> are applicable to this
document.  No further extensions are required beyond the security
mechanisms offered by <xref target="RFC3588" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="RFC3588"/>.</t>
    </section>
